      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The exploit allowed by legacy animations is quite severe, so there is no chance they will decide not to remove them. The reason they are removing them from avatars uploaded after september 1st is because the exploit was only recently discovered by most people who know about it. And even more recently it was first exploited. So removing the component from avatars uploaded after september 1st is just a safety precaution, to try and ensure that people won't be able to exploit it any longer, while not effecting all ever uploaded avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
